  "id": "co-te-de-boeuf-with-chimichurri-butter",
  "name": "Côte de boeuf with chimichurri butter",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked rib steak with herbed butter",
  "description": "A thick single-bone rib steak cooked gently, finished with a hot sear, and served with bright chimichurri butter, fries, and rocket salad.",
